  },
  {
    "slide_number": 5,
    "title": "Conclusion: The Core Principles of Molecular Inheritance",
    "bullets": [
      "DNA's **A-T, G-C pairing** is the basis for genetic information storage.",
      "**Semiconservative replication** ensures faithful copying of the genetic blueprint.",
      "**mRNA acts as the crucial intermediary**, translating DNA's code into functional proteins.",
      "These fundamental processes underpin all **molecular inheritance** and life itself."
    ]
  }
]

